TITLE 1D transport with exchange; query SI(Halite) at cell 3, step 10

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -solution true
    -distance true
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Na Cl Ca
    -si Halite

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -initial_time 0
    -print_cells 3
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 1
END
